{"id":"W2be0752d616cb1ba8fe8da5d","zh":"恶化域","en":"","name":"恶化域","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W2be0752d616cb1ba8fe8da5d","text":"恶化域","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Saea7ba9b8e84f5ea1982","source_id":"P107","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"为满足识别精度,本文将车辆系统部件的振动加速度指标划分为9个等级,每3个等级组成1个动力响应指标域,分别为整修域、恶化域及保养域,以累积概率70%、30%为临界点,域等级由低级到高级。","citations":[{"source_id":"P107","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S661e88957272d76631d5","source_id":"P107","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"由表3可知:1级整修域的识别准确率在90%以上,这是由于此区域的轨道不平顺控制指标幅值较大; 其余响应域对应的轨道不平顺指标极少达到界线1以上的范围,因此1级整修域作为线路几何状态最差的区域,其识别准确率也是最高的;其余动力响应域的识别准确率基本能达到80%左右;部分指标域的识别效果较差(如2级恶化域)。","citations":[{"source_id":"P107","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P107":{"id":"P107","title":"高速铁路车辆系统动力响应指标域估计及线路状态反演方法","authors":"徐磊,高建敏,翟婉明","year":"2016","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2016.05.013","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-region-estimation-of-dynamic-response-indexes-for-high-speed-railway-vehicle-system-and-line-status"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"位于保养与整修之间的响应区域，部分细分等级较难识别。","language":"zh","source_id":"P107","paper_slug":"2016-region-estimation-of-dynamic-response-indexes-for-high-speed-railway-vehicle-system-and-line-status","title":"高速铁路车辆系统动力响应指标域估计及线路状态反演方法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W8c22ea94a612ee07aa3712ce","name":"Deteriorating region","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W8c22ea94a612ee07aa3712ce","name":"Deteriorating region","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W8c22ea94a612ee07aa3712ce","name":"Deteriorating region","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P107","title":"高速铁路车辆系统动力响应指标域估计及线路状态反演方法","authors":"徐磊,高建敏,翟婉明","year":"2016","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2016.05.013","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-region-estimation-of-dynamic-response-indexes-for-high-speed-railway-vehicle-system-and-line-status"}]}